OL,3,AOvernight curfews announced in parts of
OL,4,AParis and Nice after riots across
OL,5,AFrance
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice announce a curfew in parts of
OL,8,Fcentral Paris following protests across
OL,9,FFrance. It's due to come into force
OL,10,Ffrom 23:00 local time (22:00 BST) and
OL,11,Flast until 06:00 - here's more from the
OL,12,Fstatement
OL,14,FIn Nice, south of France, mayor Eric
OL,15,FCiotte announces a curfew specifically
OL,16,Ffor young people. There are also
OL,17,Frestrictions in northern cities,
OL,18,Fincluding Lille
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
