OL,3,AKenya cult leader who told parents to
OL,4,Astarve children guilty of 191 murders
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwenty-eight other leaders of his cult
OL,7,Fwere also convicted of murder. They had
OL,8,Fall pleaded not guilty, repeatedly
OL,9,Finsisting that nobody was forced to
OL,10,Fdie.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
